.!saiv acme/unresolvable

// zz is a well-formed BCP 47 tag (2ALPHA language) that names no
// language CLDR knows: the schema compiles, and every conforming
// backend refuses the constraint at validation -- root fallback is
// never silent (SPEC.md section 5.3; authors wanting root
// collation say ..lex[und] explicitly).
/^.{1,100}$/ ..lex[zz]
name=
